# evpn-flatpak-shim config: "<flatpak-app-id> <synthetic-host-path>"
# Install as /etc/evpn-flatpak-shim.conf (root-owned, world-readable is fine).
# The synthetic path is never read or executed -- it only needs to be a
# string you can also enter/select in ExpressVPN's split-tunnel app list.
org.mozilla.firefox /opt/flatpak-apps/org.mozilla.firefox
com.brave.Browser /opt/flatpak-apps/com.brave.Browser
